  "name": "Clear Mind (Ex)",
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Starting at 5th level, a psychic can regain her phrenic pool points quicker. The psychic must be relaxed and free from overt distractions, such as combat raging nearby or other loud noises, and does not gain this recovery if asleep or unconscious. The psychic regains 1 phrenic pool point per hour. This increases by 1 for every five psychic levels after 5th (Clear Mind I at 5th, II at 10th, III at 15th, IV at 20th).</p>",
